-## Default 64x64 Character Spec
-
-Use `references/character_64_8f.json` as the default starting point:
-
-- 8 frames.
-- `64x64` cell.
-- `512x64` strip.
-- `baselineY = 58`.
-- `centerX = 32`.
-- target standing body height around `46px`.
-- palette limit around `24` colors.
-- hard alpha after chroma-key/background cleanup.
-
-Death/knockdown animations need phase-based validation: later prone frames are naturally shorter than standing frames.
-
-## Generation Prompt Pattern
-
-For each independent frame, use a prompt like:
-
-```text
-One frame of a low-resolution pixel-art character animation for a 32x32 tile-scale side-scrolling action game.
-Small dark gothic cyberpunk vanguard warrior, simplified for a 64x64 pixel sprite, full body visible, side-view.
-Crisp low-resolution pixel art, limited 24-color palette feel, readable silhouette, no painterly blur.
-One single character pose centered on a perfectly flat solid #00ff00 chroma-key background.
-No floor, no shadow, no labels, no UI, no watermark.
-Animation frame: <specific pose>.
-```
-
-Use sequential pose descriptions for animation beats. For death/fall:
-
-```text
-frame_00 wounded standing stagger
-frame_01 fatal hit recoil
-frame_02 knees buckle
-frame_03 falling sideways/downward
-frame_04 nearly horizontal before impact
-frame_05 impact on ground
-frame_06 prone settle
-frame_07 final still prone pose
-```
-
-For a video model gait cycle, use a stricter pattern:
-
-```text
-Create one complete side-view running gait cycle for the referenced character.
-The character keeps the same identity, outfit, proportions, helmet/head shape, colors, and silhouette across the whole motion.
-Right-facing full-body side view, centered in frame, stable screen position, flat solid #00ff00 background.
-The motion starts at a clear contact pose and ends at the matching loop boundary contact pose.
-Exactly one complete gait cycle only; no repeated cycles.
-No punch, attack, stop, jump, turn-around, facing-left flip, camera pan, zoom, crop, extra limbs, detached legs, or floating hands.
-```
-
